  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "你就是玛琪艾儿的代理啊？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C31662F739B742A827E513F76844EE37406554AFF1F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么事不宜迟，\n请你听听我的委托！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E484E8B4E0D5B9C8FDFFF0C000A8BF74F60542C542C6211768459D46258FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我对宝可梦的进化有兴趣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BF95B9D53EF68A676848FDB5316670951748DA3300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道什么是宝可梦的进化吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n例如宝可梦们通过在战斗中获得经验值，\n或是和训练家建立友好的关系，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就会发生进化，改变外形，变得更强……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而在多个进化方法当中，\n我对用道具引起的进化尤其感兴趣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C5728591A4E2A8FDB531665B96CD55F534E2DFF0C000A62115BF97528905351775F158D7776848FDB53165C245176611F51748DA3300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为此，我弄来了这块“雷之石”！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A6B64FF0C62115F0467654E868FD95757201C96F74E4B77F3201DFF01FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但可悲的是，\n我……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4653EF60B27684662FFF0C000A62112026202600100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "并没有带着能用\n雷之石进化的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E766CA167095E26774080FD7528000A96F74E4B77F38FDB531676845B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据我调查，一种叫皮卡丘的宝可梦\n能用雷之石来进化。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E62118C0367E5FF0C4E0079CD53EB76AE53614E1876845B9D53EF68A6000A80FD752896F74E4B77F367658FDB5316300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么终于能进入正题了。\n请你！给我一只皮卡丘吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E487EC84E8E80FD8FDB51656B6398984E863002000A8BF74F60FF017ED962114E0053EA76AE53614E185427FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然我不会白要的！\n我会用赫拉克罗斯来跟你换。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是说我们会来交换宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F53713662114E0D4F1A767D89817684FF01000A62114F1A75288D6B62C9514B7F5765AF67658DDF4F606362300200100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F8BF462114EEC4F1A67654EA463625B9D53EF68A6FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给我一只皮卡丘吧！\n我会用赫拉克罗斯来跟你换！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n皮卡丘呀，\n据说会出现在3号野生特区！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED962114E0053EA76AE53614E185427FF01000A62114F1A75288D6B62C9514B7F5765AF67658DDF4F606362FF0100100001BE01000A76AE53614E185440FF0C000A636E8BF44F1A51FA73B05728003353F791CE751F7279533AFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "莫、莫非你\n带着皮卡丘？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果可以的话，\n请来跟我的赫拉克罗斯交换吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83AB300183AB975E4F60000A5E26774076AE53614E18FF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C53EF4EE576848BDDFF0C000A8BF767658DDF621176848D6B62C9514B7F5765AF4EA463625427FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道我的委托内容也不肯和我交换？\n难道你只是想来跟我炫耀皮卡丘的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E590536211768459D4625851855BB94E5F4E0D80AF548C62114EA46362FF1F000A96BE90534F6053EA662F60F367658DDF621170AB800076AE53614E1876845417FF1F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托了！\n请你和我交换吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584E86FF01000A8BF74F60548C62114EA463625427FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皮卡丘！\n欢迎你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76AE53614E18FF01000A6B228FCE4F60FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了纪念我们的相遇，\n我要使用雷之石啦～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E867EAA5FF562114EEC768476F89047FF0C000A621189814F7F752896F74E4B77F35566FF5EFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皮卡丘进化成雷丘了～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76AE53614E188FDB5316621096F74E184E86FF5EFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦图鉴显示，\n雷丘它……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n储存电力过多就会更具攻击性，\n说不定会袭击训练家……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A656FE9274663E793AFF0C000A96F74E185B832026202600100001BE01000A50A85B587535529B8FC7591A5C314F1A66F45177653B51FB6027FF0C000A8BF44E0D5B9A4F1A88AD51FB8BAD7EC35BB62026202600100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯……听说除了雷之石之外，\n能让宝可梦进化的石头<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n还有许多种哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF20262026542C8BF496644E8696F74E4B77F34E4B5916FF0C000A80FD8BA95B9D53EF68A68FDB5316768477F3593400100001BE00000A8FD867098BB8591A79CD54E6300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "总、总之很感谢你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "603B3001603B4E4B5F88611F8C224F60300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也请代我向玛琪艾儿打声招呼哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8BF74EE362115411739B742A827E513F625358F062DB547C54E6FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "克罗～斯！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514B7F57FF5E65AFFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    }
